Suggested next diagnostic
-------------------------
Print the exact process exit code before the PowerShell throw and inspect the
PE import table of LuniraAgoraRoundtrip.exe/agora_rtc_sdk.dll on the runner.
If the code is STATUS_DLL_NOT_FOUND (0xC0000135), add only the missing Agora
runtime dependency to LuniraAgora.cmake and rerun the required roundtrip.
